                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/6679: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-10-29T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">October 29,
                                1925—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>308. Your 447, October 16, 7 P.M. You are authorized to instruct Consulate
                    General Canton in manner suggested in your telegram.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
